``dials.stills_process``: the PHIL fields stills indexing overrides are now restored even
when indexing raises, so a still's result no longer depends on which stills the same
process handled before it. Previously the first failed refinement left outlier rejection
disabled for the rest of that process, and ``indexing.max_cell`` -- resolved from ``Auto``
in place -- was never restored, so every later still reused the first one's estimate.
Under ``mp.method=mpi`` the image order is decided by timing, so the same job did not
reproduce run to run, or between different numbers of ranks.
